{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":485365,"name":"John Solly","username":"jsolly","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/jsolly/{size}/33752_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-07T13:18:34.438Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485365-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485365-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"chcklst-box fa fa-square-o\" data-chk-src=\"1:0\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e Cursor IDE\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"chcklst-box fa fa-square-o\" data-chk-src=\"2:0\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e Cursor CLI\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"chcklst-box fa fa-square-o\" data-chk-src=\"3:0\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e Background Agent (GitHub, Slack, Web, Linear)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"chcklst-box fa fa-square-o\" data-chk-src=\"4:0\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e BugBot\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"chcklst-box checked fa fa-square-check-o\" data-chk-src=\"5:0\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e Somewhere else: Grok Bot (also reproduces in Cursor IDE — see Additional Information)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485365-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485365-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOfficial GitHub marketplace plugin (id 48677658) stays \u003cstrong\u003eNeeds auth\u003c/strong\u003e. Clicking \u003cstrong\u003eAuthenticate\u003c/strong\u003e shows toast: \u003cstrong\u003e“Github didn’t provide a sign-in link”\u003c/strong\u003e. No browser/OAuth window. MCP \u003ccode\u003euser-Github\u003c/code\u003e: \u003ccode\u003eneedsAuth\u003c/code\u003e / \u003ccode\u003eauthentication_required\u003c/code\u003e, tools listed as 47 but unusable until auth.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485365-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485365-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGrok Bot desktop → Plugins → GitHub (installed).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAccount default shows Needs auth.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eClick Authenticate.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eToast: Github didn’t provide a sign-in link. Still Needs auth.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485365-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485365-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAuthenticate opens GitHub OAuth / provides a sign-in link and completes connection.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485365-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485365-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eScreenshots / Screen Recordings\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/f/3/f302bb2b6c51d392f559e3e324bf3268b3c7545c.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/yFLSmbVQUcifTUWjmAZniNBdb9W.png?dl=1\" title=\"github-plugin-no-signin-link.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/f/3/f302bb2b6c51d392f559e3e324bf3268b3c7545c_2_570x500.png\" alt=\"github-plugin-no-signin-link.png\" data-base62-sha1=\"yFLSmbVQUcifTUWjmAZniNBdb9W\" width=\"570\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/f/3/f302bb2b6c51d392f559e3e324bf3268b3c7545c_2_570x500.png, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/f/3/f302bb2b6c51d392f559e3e324bf3268b3c7545c.png 1.5x, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/f/3/f302bb2b6c51d392f559e3e324bf3268b3c7545c.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F5F4F5\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003egithub-plugin-no-signin-link.png\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e797×699 32.7 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485365-operating-system-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485365-operating-system-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003edarwin (macOS) arm64\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485365-version-information-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485365-version-information-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot 0.44.0 stable (desktop)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485365-additional-information-8\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485365-additional-information-8\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eAdditional Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBot name: Bug/Feature Logger\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eConversation ID: unknown — filing from this agent chat; desktop surface\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSurface: Grok Bot desktop (primary). Also fails similarly in Cursor IDE 3.19.13 arm64 (dd066f332fcea7382764400fde902f61920648d0).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePlugin: GitHub marketplace 48677658\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRelated: \u003ca href=\"https://forum.cursor.com/t/plugin-mcp-oauth-never-reaches-needsauth-authenticate-button-missing-browser-never-opens/170058\" class=\"inline-onebox\"\u003ePlugin MCP OAuth never reaches needsAuth — Authenticate button missing, browser never opens\u003c/a\u003e (different symptom — missing Authenticate / never needsAuth — opposite of this case where Needs auth shows and Authenticate is clicked)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWorked-around locally via custom github-local PAT MCP; marketplace plugin still broken\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIn-app SendFeedback also submitted for this report.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485365-does-this-stop-you-from-using-grok-bot-9\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485365-does-this-stop-you-from-using-grok-bot-9\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Grok Bot?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"chcklst-box fa fa-square-o\" data-chk-src=\"38:0\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e Yes - Grok Bot is unusable\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"chcklst-box checked fa fa-square-check-o\" data-chk-src=\"39:0\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e Sometimes - I can sometimes use Grok Bot\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"chcklst-box fa fa-square-o\" data-chk-src=\"40:0\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e No - Grok Bot works, but with this issue\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":3,"updated_at":"2026-09-08T08:05:01.948Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":15,"reads":8,"readers_count":7,"score":76.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":170898,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-github-plugin-authenticate-github-didnt-provide-a-sign-in-link","display_username":"John Solly","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://forum.cursor.com/t/plugin-mcp-oauth-never-reaches-needsauth-authenticate-button-missing-browser-never-opens/170058","internal":true,"reflection":false,"title":"Plugin MCP OAuth never reaches needsAuth — Authenticate button missing, browser never opens","clicks":0}],"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":1}],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":30025,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-github-plugin-authenticate-github-didnt-provide-a-sign-in-link/170898/1","reactions":[{"id":"+1","type":"emoji","count":1}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":1,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":486062,"name":"Mohit","username":"mohitjain","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/mohitjain/{size}/100229_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-08T08:18:26.514Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/jsolly\"\u003e@jsolly\u003c/a\u003e - this is a labeling issue, not a sign-in that’s actually failing. The GitHub plugin authenticates with the personal access token you enter under Setup Values (Edit Values), not a browser sign-in, so the badge shows Needs auth and the Authenticate button has no link to open (hence the toast). Your connector is already working — the 47 tools are loading with your token, so you can ignore that label (the custom PAT MCP you set up isn’t needed).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQuick confirm: in any bot, ask “Using the GitHub connector, which GitHub user am I signed in as?” - if it returns your username, you’re good.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis is an issue we’re tracking and I’ve added your report to it; I’ll follow up here when there’s an update. For the Cursor IDE, could you share the exact screen and status text you see there? That’s a different path, so I’d like to look at it separately.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":7,"post_type":1,"posts_count":3,"updated_at":"2026-09-08T08:18:26.514Z","reply_count":0,"