eEnvironment (confirmed):\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGrok Bot desktop \u003cstrong\u003e0.44.0\u003c/strong\u003e stable darwin\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSurface: desktop\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBot / Conversation ID: \u003ccode\u003e2d28dc6b-2e68-43b1-8974-cf75a08ad260\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSettings signed-in email: \u003ca href=\"mailto:github@jsolly.com\"\u003egithub@jsolly.com\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMarketplace plugin id \u003cstrong\u003e48677658\u003c/strong\u003e / remote MCP \u003ccode\u003euser-Github\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRelated: \u003ca href=\"https://github.com/github/github-mcp-server/issues/3238\" class=\"inline-onebox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003eCursor/Grok Bot marketplace plugin: Authenticate fails with \"Github didn't provide a sign-in link\" · Issue #3238 · github/github-mcp-server · GitHub\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCursor support: T-F57077\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eScreenshot (Plugins → GitHub → Needs auth + fetch failed toast):\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/4/5/4538aa0dc2929a806db1d4e254dcded26b868710.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/9SmlA77WvB8CHaPqfHjrwIohJ5K.png?dl=1\" title=\"github-fetch-failed-toast.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/4/5/4538aa0dc2929a806db1d4e254dcded26b868710_2_576x500.png\" alt=\"github-fetch-failed-toast.png\" data-base62-sha1=\"9SmlA77WvB8CHaPqfHjrwIohJ5K\" width=\"576\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/4/5/4538aa0dc2929a806db1d4e254dcded26b868710_2_576x500.png, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/4/5/4538aa0dc2929a806db1d4e254dcded26b868710.png 1.5x, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/4/5/4538aa0dc